    "Slowed Down" : {

    },
    "Slowed-down accounts have a limit on how many of their posts appear in your feed at once. Tap a username in the feed to slow someone down." : {

    },
    "Snapshots are saved automatically when your following list changes. Up to 50 are kept." : {

