    },
    "The Cashu protocol uses Blind Diffie-Hellman key exchange (BDHKE) so the mint signs your tokens without seeing them:" : {

    },
    "The feed reads from multiple relays to build your timeline. Connect to relays your followers are actively using." : {

    },
    "The import process will fetch your own notes and notes where you are tagged. Make sure you have your npub set correctly in the Identity tab." : {

    },
    "The JSON file containing relays to broadcast notes to." : {

    },
    "The Lightning Bridge lets you move sats between Lightning and Ecash in two taps. Fund ecash from Lightning for spending, cash out back to Lightning when you want." : {

    },
    "The relay listens on all network interfaces (0.0.0.0). Default port is 3355." : {

    },
    "These limits help protect your relay from spam and abuse." : {

    },
    "This action cannot be undone. All your relay data will be lost and the app will quit." : {

    },
