    },
    "What's happening?" : {

    },
    "When autoplay is off, videos show a thumbnail until tapped. Cache TTL controls how long downloaded media is kept before automatic cleanup. Clearing the cache will remove downloaded remote images but won't touch your local Blossom data. Profile picture prefetching downloads avatars for all followed accounts once per day over Wi-Fi only." : {

    },
    "Why are you reporting this?" : {

    },
    "WoT determines who can post to your inbox and chat relays. Lower depth is more private." : {

